# Madhav E-Commerce Sales Dashboard

This project is an interactive Power BI dashboard created to analyze Madhav E-Commerce sales data.

## Project Overview
The dashboard provides insights into sales, profit, quantity, customer behavior, and payment methods.

## Tools Used
- Microsoft Power BI
- Microsoft Excel

## Files Included
- Dashboard.png
- Dashboard.pbix
- Details.xlsx
- Orders.xlsx

## Key Analysis
- Sales and Profit Analysis
- State-wise Sales
- Monthly Profit Trends
- Category-wise Analysis
- Payment Mode Analysis
- Customer Analysis
